(7469768, 1185937, 25024, '<td valign="top"><br/>Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge fully.<br/> <br/>I recognised whose work this was as soon as I saw it! Well done in winning this challenge with this superb abstract its in a class of its own. Youve made a lovely job with this unusual bokeh, even better than last time, though I do miss the lovely model. Everything about it is exquisite, the colours, the patterns and shapes, the composition, even the blown highlights are pure white shapes that add to the overall result. Certainly, in terms of the challenge brief, it doesnt get any more abstract than this! Well done Eugene, thanks for your truly creative entry</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge fully. I recognised whose work this was as soon as I saw it! Well done in winning this challenge with this superb abstract its in a class of its own. Youve made a lovely job with this unusual bokeh, even better than last time, though I do miss the lovely model. Everything about it is exquisite, the colours, the patterns and shapes, the composition, even the blown highlights are pure white shapes that add to the overall result. Certainly, in terms of the challenge brief, it doesnt get any more abstract than this! Well done Eugene, thanks for your truly creative entry', '2016-08-26 07:15:47.000000', NULL, 0),
