(7468960, 1185996, 68504, '<td valign="top">I must get me a bustier and walk so fast... and maybe a root beer with a straw. Very Hegelian (I think): the abstract so full of feminine being. Actually I don''t remember Hegel referring to the feminine. So the world revolves in its endless dialectic but Woman maintains.</td>', 'I must get me a bustier and walk so fast... and maybe a root beer with a straw. Very Hegelian (I think): the abstract so full of feminine being. Actually I don''t remember Hegel referring to the feminine. So the world revolves in its endless dialectic but Woman maintains.', '2016-08-19 01:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
